1..4
# Subtest: can not access private method without a trust
    1..2
    ok 1 - 'Truster.new()!Truster::get-x-priv' died
    ok 2 - right exception type (X::Method::Private::Permission)
ok 1 - can not access private method without a trust
ok 2 - can access private method with trust
ok 3 - can access private method with trust + subclass
# Subtest: trust relation does not extend to child classes of the trustee
    1..2
    ok 1 - 'class ChildTrustee is Trustee { method x($t) { $t!Truster::get-x-priv()} }' died
    ok 2 - right exception type (X::Method::Private::Permission)
ok 4 - trust relation does not extend to child classes of the trustee
